quic.zig, entity.zig and entity-tool.zig are the Reflect QUIC stack, the
entity key and name code, and the `entity name <key-file>` tool from
WorldTreeNetwork/homoiconic commit e9a4c86a80c80c6c2672f1d65d4478c3bc85ea02
(unikernel/quic.zig, unikernel/entity.zig, unikernel/entity-tool.zig),
copied unmodified.
host.zig is the Mjolnir host client written against that stack, after
homoiconic's unikernel/quic-client.zig at the same commit.
The homoiconic tree is not modified.

Build (Zig 0.16), from the repository root, on the Linux host:

  zig build-exe native/reflect_quic/host.zig -lc -O ReleaseFast \
    -femit-bin=priv/reflect-quic-client
  zig build-exe native/reflect_quic/entity-tool.zig -lc -O ReleaseFast \
    -femit-bin=priv/reflect-entity
